            "exact_contribution": {
                "added": [
                    "#Cream together the butter with the sugar until light and moist.<br><br>[[Image:Make Basic Cupcakes Step 1 Version 2.jpg|center]]",
                    "#Add the eggs (one at a time) to the batter. Mix it well.<ref>https://www.foodnetwork.com/recipes/food-network-kitchen/go-to-vanilla-cupcakes-3338835</ref> (It may look like it's curdling but don't worry.)<br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 3.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 3-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 3 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Add the flour with the baking soda and milk. Mix well until all bits of flour disappear.<ref>https://www.foodnetwork.com/recipes/food-network-kitchen/go-to-vanilla-cupcakes-3338835</ref><br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Add the batter into the cupcake liners. Fill them half up.<br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 7.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 7-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 7 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Bake the cupcakes for 15-20 minutes. Insert a toothpick and if it comes out clean your cupcakes are done.<ref>https://www.bonappetit.com/story/how-to-tell-baked-good-is-done</ref><br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8 Version 2.jpg}}"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#Mix together the butter with the sugar until light and fluffy.<br><br>[[Image:Make Basic Cupcakes Step 1 Version 2.jpg|center]]",
                    "#Add the eggs one at a time to the batter, Mix it well after each egg.<ref>https://www.foodnetwork.com/recipes/food-network-kitchen/go-to-vanilla-cupcakes-3338835</ref> (It may look like it's curdling but don't worry.)<br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 3.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 3-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 3 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Add the flour, the baking soda, and milk. Mix until just combined and no streaks of flour remain.<ref>https://www.foodnetwork.com/recipes/food-network-kitchen/go-to-vanilla-cupcakes-3338835</ref><br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Fill each cupcake liner halfway with batter to allow room for rising.",
                    "p.<br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 7.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 7-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 7 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Bake the cupcakes for 15-20 minutes. Insert a toothpick into the center; if it comes out clean, your cupcakes are done.<ref>https://www.bonappetit.com/story/how-to-tell-baked-good-is-done</ref><br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8 Version 2.jpg}}"
                ]
            }
        },
