                    "#Add the flour with the baking soda and milk. Mix well until all bits of flour disappear.<ref>https://www.foodnetwork.com/recipes/food-network-kitchen/go-to-vanilla-cupcakes-3338835</ref><br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Preheat oven to {{convert|350|F|round=5}}.<ref>https://www.eggs.ca/recipes/classic-vanilla-cupcakes</ref>[[Image:Make Basic Cupcakes Step 5 Version 2.jpg|center]]",
                    "#Line your cupcake pan with cupcake liners.<ref>https://www.taste.com.au/recipes/classic-cupcakes/85286555-6ff1-40cc-a7aa-c8e63cb17933</ref><br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 6.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 6-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 6 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Bake the cupcakes for 15-20 minutes. Insert a toothpick and if it comes out clean your cupcakes are done.<ref>https://www.bonappetit.com/story/how-to-tell-baked-good-is-done</ref><br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8 Version 2.jpg}}"
                ],
                "removed": [
                    "#Add the eggs (one at a time) to the batter. Mix it well. (It may look like it's curdling but don't worry.)<br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 3.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 3-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 3 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Add the flour with the baking soda and milk. Mix well until all bits of flour disappear.<br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 4 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Preheat oven to {{convert|350|F|round=5}}.[[Image:Make Basic Cupcakes Step 5 Version 2.jpg|center]]",
                    "#Line your cupcake pan with cupcake liners.<br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 6.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 6-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 6 Version 2.jpg}}",
                    "#Bake the cupcakes for 15-20 minutes. Insert a toothpick and if it comes out clean your cupcakes are done.<br><br>{{whvid|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8.360p.mp4|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8-preview.jpg|Make Basic Cupcakes Step 8 Version 2.jpg}}"
                ]
            }
        },
